  "note": "Machine source of truth for module inventory and edges. Edit this file, then run python3 modules/bake_static.py to refresh modules/index.html (static; file:// OK; no fetch). Architecture: FE two modules (fe-decision 决策路径 · fe-cube 立方体面) + BE one module; FE-API (region fe-api) sits outside both FE frames as contract hub. Optional module.region is consumed by bake with fallback. Edge colors by side pair (FE内翠绿 #00a86b / BE内天青 #5dade2 / 跨侧亮红 #e02020); dash by type. Routing: channel + edge-slot orthogonal polylines (no cross / no coincide). Cross-side data contract is only FE-API→BE-HTTP (plus BE-HTTP→MODULES-TRACK narrow mouth). Direct page→data-module contract edges (BOARD→BICS-HIER, LIST→ENTITY, OPENCUBE→BUNDLE) removed 2026-10-14: they duplicated the API path and read as if the browser opened library modules. Shell layer (2026-10-14, local app): SHELL-WINDOW + SHELL-PROC sit below both sides in their own zone; shell-internal edges use graphite; SHELL→BE-HTTP is cross-side (red). P2: SHELL-PACK (build-time packaging) joins the shell zone with two depends edges. Second-mapping spot slice (2026-10-16): fe-map + BE-DEBT + Map desk. Interactive ChartSpec reform (2026-10-21, GS-20261021-IX-CHARTSPEC): BE-CHARTSPEC (compile/OPS/persist) + FE-CMD (deterministic command bar); shell blank stage via ChartSpec; NVDA chain adapts doc→Spec→compile; edges BUNDLE→CHARTSPEC, HTTP→CHARTSPEC, NVDA-LINKS→CHARTSPEC, CHARTSPEC→NVDA-LAYOUT, OPENCUBE→CMD, CMD→API, PANEL→API. Personal home and Fed chart (2026-10-22, GS-20261022-FED-HUB-P1): FE-HUB, FE-FED-MODEL, FE-FED-DRAW, BE-FED-GRAPH.",
